    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$y=2x^2-1$, where $-1\\le x\\le1$.",
      "worked": "Let $x=\\cos t$ and $y=\\cos 2t$.\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=\\cos 2t\\\\y&=2\\cos^2t-1\\\\y&=2x^2-1.\\end{align*}$$\nSince $x=\\cos t$, the curve is $\\boxed{y=2x^2-1,\\quad -1\\le x\\le1}$.",
